{"content":[{"c":["JEDIAEL"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Benjamin’s son (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.7.6,10-11","r":"1Chr.7.6,10-11","rawR":"1Chr.7.6,10-11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.7.6,10-11","value":"1Chr.7.6,10-11"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 7:6, 10-11"},"), whose descendants were warriors, numbering 17,200 by David’s time. Some suggest that he is identifiable with Ashbel, also Benjamin’s son (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.46.21","r":"Gen.46.21","rawR":"Gen.46.21","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.46.21","value":"Gen.46.21"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 46:21"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[{"c":["See also"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=AshbelAshbelite_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"AshbelAshbelite_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"AshbelAshbelite_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Ashbel, Ashbelite"},"."],"sourceClass":"list-text","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Shimri’s son, listed among David’s mighty men (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.11.45","r":"1Chr.11.45","rawR":"1Chr.11.45","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.11.45","value":"1Chr.11.45"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 11:45"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. One who deserted Saul to join David at Ziklag (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.12.20","r":"1Chr.12.20","rawR":"1Chr.12.20","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.12.20","value":"1Chr.12.20"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 12:20"},"). He may be the same as #2 above."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["4. Member of the Levitical family of Korah, appointed a doorkeeper of the temple during David’s reign (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.26.2","r":"1Chr.26.2","rawR":"1Chr.26.2","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.26.2","value":"1Chr.26.2"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 26:2"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Jediael","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"1 Chr 7:6, 10-11","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.7.6,10-11","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.7.6,10-11","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.7.6,10-11"},{"anchorText":"Gn 46:21","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.46.21","rawQueryValue":"Gen.46.21","sourceRefExact":"Gen.46.21"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 11:45","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.11.45","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.11.45","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.11.45"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 12:20","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.12.20","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.12.20","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.12.20"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 26:2","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.26.2","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.26.2","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.26.2"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"bd829e127fdc1ad934f0fcd762fdd4a3bf5df6795c4bf57ff1646475b8ff3fec","sourceItemName":"Jediael","sourceItemOrder":129,"sourceMember":"Articles/J.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Jediael","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Jediael","title":"Jediael","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}